  "job_B14.32_20251003_114311": {
    "chunk_text": ". Gif hwilc tunesman \u00e6nigne p\u00e6nig forhele o\u00f0\u00f0e forh\u00e6bbe, gilde se landrica \u00feone p\u00e6nig & nime \u00e6nne Gif hwa teo\u00f0inge forhealde & he sy cyninges \u00feegn, gilde X healfmarc, landagende VI healfmarc, ceorl And we forbeoda\u00f0 on Godes forbode, \u00fe\u00e6t nan man na ma wifa n\u00e6bbe buton I; & seo beo mid rihte & \u00fe\u00e6t nan man ne wifige on neahsibban men \u00feonne wi\u00f0utan \u00feam IIII cneowe; ne nan man on his & gif hit hwa gedo, nabbe he Godes mildse, buton he geswice & bete, swa biscop get\u00e6ce. Gif he \u00feonne on \u00f0am unrihte geendige, \u00feolige he cl\u00e6nes legeres & Godes mildse. Gif hwa wi\u00f0 nunnan forlicge, sy \u00e6g\u00f0er his weres scildig, ge he ge heo. & gif hi on \u00f0am geendigan buton geswicennesse, \u00feolian cl\u00e6nes legeres & Godes mildse. Gif hwa his riht\u00e6we lifigende forl\u00e6te & on o\u00f0ran wife on unriht gewifige, n\u00e6bbe he Godes myldse, Ac healde gehwa mid rihte his \u00e6we \u00fea hwile \u00fee heo libbe; buton \u00fe\u00e6t gewur\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t hi buta geceosan be Gif \u00e6nig man heonan for\u00f0 rihte laga wyrde, gebete hit georne. Ealle we sculon \u00e6nne God lufian & wur\u00f0ian & \u00e6nne Cristendom georne healdan & \u00e6lcne h\u00e6\u00f0endom & we willa\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t landceap & lahceap & witword & getrywe gewitnes & riht dom & fulloc & Sit nomen Domini benedictum ex hoc nunc et usque in seculum..",
